Zero point energy                ...      0.22044084 Eh     138.33 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00756015 Eh       4.74 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
